Adds the 'Deploy local AI' capability: hardware detection (CPU/RAM/GPU via nvidia-smi/rocm-smi-/proc), a curated HuggingFace GGUF catalog with recommendation, async download with progress, and llama-server launch with readiness polling. Wired into CLI (hardware, deploy-local-ai) and HTTP API (/hardware, /deploy-local-ai). Verified build + hardware command + graceful error when llama-server absent. Does not auto-install llama.cpp; documents the requirement.
